Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jolyne make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So she can go to the Discipline Cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to find that same bone\Nbelonging to Dio? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep her safe through this,\Nthen I plan on making her my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the condition. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The electrical power a\Nnerve carries at any given
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,time measures a mere seven\Nhundredths of a volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how little power that stand has.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor's attacks make one feel\Nnothing, and it does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All it does is make them mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say it's more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see where your\Nstrengths lie from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,your most dominant muscle\Ngroups, and they're glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Fight Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've just gotta say, every\None of you pisses me the hell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,AND I'M FREAKIN' SICK OF YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand user must be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, just a question of who.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be willing to bet it's the\None who made the guards fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't drag my ass all\Nthe way to this maximum
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,security disciplinary wing to not\Nget a hold of that bone. F that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough shit for any stupid\Nchump who gets in my way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever it is, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I really just have that thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this burning, furious\Nemotion taking me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that fighting spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit that keeps on telling me\Nto conquer and destroy everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter who it is or what\Nmight end up happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this guard really\Ntrying to pull off the same
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,thing with me that he\Ndid to the other guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be that stupid, can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for Stone Ocean, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see where your point\Nof strength is, FE-40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something flowing slowly from your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,muscles that looks like\Na thread made of liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the strongest power you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of move was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When he fought that other prisoner before,\Nhe was bizarrely brutal and savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And that was just a fist fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No normal humans are\Ncapable of these moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to beat this guard\Nat any cost, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see his muscles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And they look brilliant and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the way he just moved,\Nthe agility, the power…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How can humans sustain\Nhuge wounds like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then ignore that pain and fear\Nand still attack so viciously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the intense radiance emanating from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,his muscles is the marker\Nof his strong point,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that tells me something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His left leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see inside it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the leg that I just attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can tell the damage\NI dealt is murder for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shitstain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You get in my way, then\NI'm gonna choke you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I have to pound you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, these guys are getting into it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to knock this guy out already,\Nso I can focus on finding Dio's bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost chopped off\Nyour own head just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep, you jacked up prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what the my arm but what the hell just\Nhappened shit who is this guy what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell have you done to me wait
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the so this guard is a stand user
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,too i don't believe it this entire ward\Nis full of stand users with that disc
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he was already granted a stand power\Nbut i don't know what it is But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,what exactly did he just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even give him the\Nslightest chance to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no sign of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no way he could know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did he attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing a ton of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had a wound like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like one you'd get\Nfrom any knife, razor, or blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If his stand was a power type,\Nthen I totally should have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrap your thread around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see a thread as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A bundle of threads inside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're your point of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to make\Na bit more sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But without them, you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all sparkles and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So when did you become a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand finally appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he did now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's the assassin sent to eliminate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then I have an idea of what I\Nhave to do to eliminate him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need extra power to\Ndefend myself with threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A straight punch with\Ndevastating force will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,deviate significantly when\Nthe direction is shifted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll avoid any impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you used both your hands,\NI was able to block your movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I can stop you\Nand not look at your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting you out of\Ncommission for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see it. How can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine now, you\Nlow-rent, filthy pizza jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to make fun of me\Nwhen you're the real joke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's laughing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoners are the scum of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing\Nthat pisses me off more
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,than being defied by\Na scum queen like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I felt like that the\Nentire time I've worked in this pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't fuck with me, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to let out all of my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what's about to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna snap and let all my anger out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let all my anger out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna let it out and feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that means his stand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get myself out of this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I know what his stand\Npower is, and here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've completely locked you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a big prison guard, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My job entails restraining lunatic inmates\Nlike you every day. At first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my right arm is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But the point of this headlock\Nisn't only to choke you out you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,understand feel that if I twist\Nyour left shoulder joint like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When I pin you like this your right\Nshoulder is dead and you can't raise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So try as you might you can't do\Nshit to me with your right fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm suddenly aware this headlock\Nleaves part of me unguarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't believe I'm\Nabout to tell you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,which are now close to a certain right\Nhand that could probably crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Under different circumstances,\NI'd be psyched about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to keep your\Ngrubby little hand away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it stands real identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I going to get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what's happening to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The glass is cracking everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck, it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I blew out his eardrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His grip loosened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In the universe, there are more rocks\Nand dust particles than can be measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of them close enough to Earth\Nfall down due to its gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Although most of them burn out upon\Nentry into the Earth's atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,if the rock itself can control and maintain\Nthe optimum drop speed, trajectory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and its structural integrity...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're coming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry yourself, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, but I give the orders\Nand make the decisions here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I know I asked for your assistance,\Nbut that doesn't put you in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,if Pale Snake is trying to eliminate\NJolene as I keep on telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:14:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he may actually have sent two\Nassassins to the Discipline Cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you didn't think of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably made more than three\Nstand users to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you and I are going\Nto go track them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,blow their asses off the map,\Nand then come straight back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back before that guard even\Nstarts his pre-wake-up twitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we sealed the deal about\NJolene and I getting married,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'd better not\Ntry to double-cross me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what the\Nfuck you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Enlighten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteors are falling towards\NEarth, and directly to this guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what was attacking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand pulls down goddamn\Nfireball asteroids from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But they always conveniently miss\Nhim and burn to harmless ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes another one, like\Nit hurt me or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.22,0:15:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, and rest assured,\Nthis time I'm not letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the winner, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I shine like a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the strongest here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to rip the\Nskit off your whole body!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I barely dodged getting\Ncrushed by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my best to alter the meteor's path\Nso it would nail that crazy fuck directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it did the same thing\Nthey've all been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not even one teeny\Nlittle scratch on that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When they get near him, they\Njust disintegrate into dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That guard's stand power is so intense,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.24,0:16:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he magnetizes meteors falling right\Ntoward his body and he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But, no matter what I do or how I do\Nit, when I have to get close to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow the only one who's in any\Nactual danger of getting hit is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is kind of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Churns of flaming stones are crashing down\Nfrom the sky all around me everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are they meteors then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what my point of strength is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, F.E. 40536, how many times\Ndid you get hit, Cupcake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those wounds look pretty nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see both arms, your left\Nside, and your right leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Five gashes in total, or is it six?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one is going to be the\Nmoney shot, the goodnight kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady, you are bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even have the strength\Nto move right now, much less stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you bluffing, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Any minute, your brick's on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arms are about as useful for\Nfighting as a pair of wet ankle socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your muscle\Ntissue rotting and dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all dark like your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them have that\Nbrilliant sparkle like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we go another round?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just to see how\Ndamaged you are, I'll bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Huh? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a swing at me, I'm defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of strike you're gonna use?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe I should close my eyes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there it is. That's\Nthe bone I need. The same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,one that PaleSnake is\Nlooking for i found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right over there.\NI have to get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing you\Ncan't fight anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd\Nput your back against
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the wall to shield yourself\Nfrom falling Medias!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey it sure did work out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The media were already falling towards me\Nfrom the other side of the wall. You lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I win turns out i was right\Non the money that tight little
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,body is too wrecked to defend\Nmy attacks and now you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Die. How does it go again? One\Nprisoner sees the wall but the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,other side of it is and the other\Nsees the stars through the bars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which one am i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there's the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,over there if i can just get to Pale
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake i'll do whatever it takes i\Ncan drink filthy water i'll finally
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,become stronger than anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,course i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,see the stars until
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,i see my father again i only want\Nto gaze into their fierce light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is it? Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the finishing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna vaporize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The fatal last blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't defend myself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even with Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you were so busy being\Nawesome, I took off your right boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaky little shit pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She even filled my boot\Nwith broken pieces of brick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's getting pouted!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But now taking a lot less damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy has shifted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The meteors will burn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They might come close,\Nbut they'll never hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Except…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that only goes for the\Nmeteors, right? Ah! My boot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop being such a drama queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy rat and\Ncriminal! Stone? Potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like she's never\Nsatisfied with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She refuses to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know if something else\Nmanages to hit the meteor first,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then it can actually get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in horrible shit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be so\Nviolent, so cruel to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:21:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This bitch beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll see the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Game, set, and match!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.36,0:23:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.78,0:24:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
